== diagnostics ==
error[E0905]: `/` is not supported on `decimal`
 --> app/app.veld:18:17
   |
18 |   rule divides: price / 2 <= other
   |                 ^^^^^^^^^
  = help: decimal division needs a rounding rule; write `a <= b * 2`, not `a / 2 <= b`

error[E0905]: `%` is not supported on `decimal`
 --> app/app.veld:19:19
   |
19 |   rule remainder: price % 2 == other
   |                   ^^^^^^^^^
  = help: decimal division needs a rounding rule; write `a <= b * 2`, not `a / 2 <= b`

error[E0905]: `<` is not supported on `string`
 --> app/app.veld:20:16
   |
20 |   rule orders: name < "b"
   |                ^^^^^^^^^^
  = help: strings are compared with `==`, `!=`, `in`, `startsWith`, `endsWith` and `contains`

error[E0905]: `==` is not supported on `Inner`
 --> app/app.veld:21:24
   |
21 |   rule comparesModels: inner == inner
   |                        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  = help: models, unions, lists, maps, `bytes` and `json` cannot be compared; compare fields

